<title>USA: Cinergi says shareholder suits dismissed.</title>
<headline>Cinergi says shareholder suits dismissed.</headline>
<dateline>SANTA MONICA, Calif. 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cinergi Pictures Entertainment Inc said that class action shareholder lawsuits filed last May against the company and some current and former officers have been dismissed.</p>
<p>Cinergi is an independent producer and distributor of motion pictures.</p>
